# NOTE: Setup lists of resource names that are embedded within the Badge
#       plugin.  All of these are tested and verified by the test suite;
#       also, setup the lists of other (auxiliary) resource related test
#       information, e.g. expected counts, script flags, etc.
#
# TODO: Always update this (primary) list when adding or removing plugin
#       resources.  Additionally, if adding a script certificate for the
#       loader package, library package, or test package, make sure the
#       "nonLibrary" offset (below) is incremented as necessary.
#
# TODO: Are these lists useful to anybody outside of the test suite?
#
###############################################################################

